  "lang-fairy-book-alt-transcriptions": "duplicate: other PG transcriptions of a coloured fairy book (PG 640 Yellow, 3027 Orange, 3282 Brown, 3454 Lilac, 6746 Grey, 7277 Green) — the H. J. Ford-illustrated transcription is held instead",
  "lang-letters-to-dead-authors-1491": "duplicate: PG 1491, a second transcription of Letters to Dead Authors (PG 3319 held)",
